    10 11	4.22	029	+21	0.4	1.4	8.3	1.5	#11 on top of block in middle of chamber
    data normal from to length compass clino 
    extend ignore 11 12
    11 12	6.05	043	+54
    1 12	0.84	329	+28
    
    #Passage connects back up 
    data normal from to length compass clino left right up down    
    11 13	2.98	141	-27	0.8	0.2	0.6	0	#13
    13 14	5.23	068	+06	0.9	1.3	0.7	0.6	#14
    14 15	3.60	131	-03	2.2	0.5	0.1	0.6	#15
