    17 18	8.40	134	-12
    # 18 continues and joins elsewhere.  No LRUD.      
    
    #Loop passage under rope
    data normal from to length compass clino left right up down    
    extend ignore 14 19
    14 19	4.26	294	-03	0.5	1.4	1.8	0.2	#19
    data normal from to length compass clino 
